<title>POLAND: BRE JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 15.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE JUNE NET RISES TO PLN 15.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 15.53 vs   11.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   17.38 vs   14.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 32.98 vs   30.35</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	69.29 vs   38.29</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 68.33 vs   68.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   90.02 vs  100.19</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		177.01 vs  157.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     336.09 vs  226.82</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
